Ricci convention: `ricci K X Y = trace (Z ↦ R(Z,X)Y)`. And in CurvatureAlgebra, `ricci_eq_ricciSum : ricci K X Y = ricciSum e K X Y = ∑ i, e.repr (K (e i) X Y) i`.

