So `R(Z,X)Y = -1/4[(Z·Y)X - (X·Y)Z]`.

Then trace over Z of `Z ↦ R(Z,X)Y` with `X, Y` fixed: In basis e_i: `∑_i e_i.repr(R(e_i,X)Y) i = ∑_i (R(e_i,X)Y)_i`.

